/Data/Note/Page(/title= "Resolve")
  # Which note a wiki link names, out of the notes the vault holds.
    
    By its path within the vault, [Archive/Plan](Archive/Plan.md), before the note its name alone would name, [Plan](Plan.md).
    
    The first of two of the name the walk found, [Twin](Archive/Twin.md); with the extension written out, [Twin.md](Archive/Twin.md),
    and by a path with it written out, [Archive/Twin.md](Archive/Twin.md). The other of the two is named only by its path,
    [Drafts/Twin](Drafts/Twin.md).
    
    A name ending in something which is not the markdown extension, [Version 1.2](Version%201.2.md), and a note the
    vault does not hold, [[Missing]].
